{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"8dcbca33-5cc2-4e25-9487-1a26a9427d3c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已读取 Q5.4。现在执行 **Step 1.2 语义分割**，将问题拆成逻辑链条。\n\n## Q5.4 逻辑链条分解\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 | 长匹配 Query |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|-------------|\n| S1 | 硬件架构中支持多算子/微算子并发的关键方法（数据流设计、计算单元组织、控制/访存体系、互联架构） | 对象/核心机制 | dataflow, compute unit, memory hierarchy, interconnect, multi-operator concurrency | `\"dataflow design\" \"compute unit\" hardware accelerator multi-operator` |\n| S2 | 在实际硬件平台上的对应实现是什么？ | 实现映射 | GPU SM Tensor Core, NPU 达芬奇 寒武纪, TPU, IPU, systolic array CGRA implementation | `GPU \"Tensor Core\" SM NPU accelerator microarchitecture implementation` |\n| S3 | 涉及哪些框架、工具链和硬件设计流程（RTL / HLS / SystemC / Chisel / Verilog / VHDL）？ | 工具链/设计流程 | RTL, HLS, Chisel, Verilog, FPGA prototyping, ASIC flow, EDA tools | `RTL HLS Chisel Verilog \"hardware design flow\" FPGA ASIC EDA` |\n\n现在执行 **Step 1.3 四目录并行搜索**，对每个节点从 Level A 开始。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":22072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26351309-2606-4983-8cbb-18644b034655","uuid":"8b4cdfb4-16e8-4871-abc6-92e68931760a"}
